Gemma
-----
The sarcasm classifiers in this project are LoRA adapters for google/gemma-2-2b
and are Model Derivatives of Gemma.

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

Anyone using the adapters must accept those terms and is bound by the use
restrictions in Section 3.2 of them.

